It is absurd that in 2025 customers come and find no one at the checkout, leave and come back and still no one..... 70 min.... still no one.... with the answer lunch break🤦.

And we complain about AI which risks replacing humans.....

@Othmane-Benjelloune, I promise you that your investment in AI, although it will be expensive, the return on investment will be much more profitable and beneficial.

